			"notes": "Cordlink adds positional Discord voice to Minecraft on Windows.\n\nInstall:\n- put the `.jar` into `.minecraft/mods`\n- launch Minecraft with Fabric\n- link your Discord account\n- press `Sync` in-game\n- leave and rejoin the voice channel\n\nNotes:\n- Windows only\n- Discord desktop required\n- native files are bundled inside the jar and extracted automatically\n- antivirus/security software may react to this behavior\n\n\nThis version is for 1.21.1-4 fabric"
